Design and implement the website mobile-first.



Assume a large percentage of visitors will arrive from mobile devices, especially through social media and WhatsApp.



The mobile experience must NOT feel like a shrunken desktop website.



Pay particular attention to:



* navigation

* property cards

* image galleries

* buttons

* enquiry forms

* WhatsApp CTA

* typography

* spacing

* touch targets

* sticky actions

* loading performance



